{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Slime Scientist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your own lab where all the slime-making happens. You\u2019ve got everything you need to mix, stretch, and get creative. Combine ingredients to create your own slime from scratch. Experiment to find your favorite formula!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/5c84949d82d060e3c2ed3ce730ebaeb1.poster.avif?t=1769623432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/5c84949d82d060e3c2ed3ce730ebaeb1.webm?t=1769623432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/5c84949d82d060e3c2ed3ce730ebaeb1.mp4?t=1769623432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Slime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime can be anything you want it to be. Shape it into food, create slime pets, or make something entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/cb54d9afc39fc366680df93f47163da0.poster.avif?t=1769623432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/cb54d9afc39fc366680df93f47163da0.webm?t=1769623432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/cb54d9afc39fc366680df93f47163da0.mp4?t=1769623432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are endless combinations!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play around with tons of colors</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add charms, glow effects, and tweak the stickiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melt it down or freeze it into a new shape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever theme you're feeling, you've got the charms to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/a2f7711c09c6a42dec868892f1bb5caa.poster.avif?t=1769623432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/a2f7711c09c6a42dec868892f1bb5caa.webm?t=1769623432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/a2f7711c09c6a42dec868892f1bb5caa.mp4?t=1769623432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fulfill Customer Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are counting on you! Match their orders as best you can, and see how your creations measure up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run the Lab</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your lab stocked and running. Order supplies, upgrade your tools, and unlock new ingredients. The better your setup, the more you can create.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lab Intern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683570/0723072fbc2001255c9815a96b416fa8822ad4ed.jpg"},{"name":"Junior Chemist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683570/35048a22702e0629bb5a00b32c783aa620cae803.jpg"},{"name":"Slime Scientist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683570/79a323bf41eebba41bb46f271fa25368a5e1e2d1.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683570/8af5ff357f4db94aa6241937862126d05b859e6f.jpg"},{"name":"Chemistry Gone Wrong","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683570/356b12c765d720ca12242f071181caae1fea2c75.jpg"},{"name":"Rapid Reaction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683570/b192be38f43ce39caeccf08682edffe986b187b5.jpg"},{"name":"Absolute Precision","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683570/06443304b930f0cd53bdd8c44b9026e1f48f604a.jpg"},{"name":"Floating Formula","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683570/a085da87b79fa495fc4331fb345133fb21f6499f.jpg"},{"name":"The Non-Newtonian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683570/16d520ff8507370ad34a6bb435b6e14f25b5c297.jpg"},{"name":"Independent Research","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683570/20a8f3e45889c1bdbaa4a6438b0d9cf782b91650.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683570?t=1769623432","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/0c414038a862dee184d6d51c18987be83ccc9da3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769623432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/fdd3cff4103854879f892b218b7c2d2eb984b60e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769623432","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/fdd3cff4103854879f892b218b7c2d2eb984b60e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769623432","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Slime Scientist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your own lab where 